    "title": "Novus WatchFace",
    "description": "\u2605 <b>Novus Watch Face is fully  Wear OS 4.0 supported</b>\r\n\r\nNovus Watch Face for Wear OS is full of digital interactive functions.\r\nWatchFace contains a huge number and user-friendly settings on the watch and the phone companion app.\r\n\r\nIt comes with Free and Premium versions. \r\nUnleash the full potential with Premium - unlock all features and functions.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2605\u2605  DISCLAIMER:  \u2605\u2605\u2605 \r\n The watch face is standalone app but the complication for phone battery requires a connection with the companion app on Android phone devices. iPhone users can not have this data due to iOS limitation.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b>\r\n!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! \r\nrichface.watch@gmail.com\r\n\r\n<b>The watch face CAN NOT be installed on smartwatches with TizenOS (Samsung Gear 2, 3, Galaxy Watch, ...) or any other OS except WearOS </b>\r\n\r\n\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained\r\nhttps://www.richface.watch/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2605 <b>Novus Watch Face is fully  Wear OS 4.0 supported</b><br><br>Novus Watch Face for Wear OS is full of digital interactive functions.<br>WatchFace contains a huge number and user-friendly settings on the watch and the phone companion app.<br><br>It comes with Free and Premium versions. <br>Unleash the full potential with Premium - unlock all features and functions.<br><br>\u2605\u2605\u2605  DISCLAIMER:  \u2605\u2605\u2605 <br> The watch face is standalone app but the complication for phone battery requires a connection with the companion app on Android phone devices. iPhone users can not have this data due to iOS limitation.<br><br>\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b><br>!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! <br>richface.watch@gmail.com<br><br><b>The watch face CAN NOT be installed on smartwatches with TizenOS (Samsung Gear 2, 3, Galaxy Watch, ...) or any other OS except WearOS </b><br><br>\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained<br>https://www.richface.watch/privacy",
